/E (International Markets Formulations \(9% in Q1 FY25 vs 10% in FY22\):The company's international markets division comprises of the Emerging Markets \(selected territories in Asia Pacific, Middle East, Africa and Latin America\) and Europe \(France, Spain and the UK\). It operates in the branded generics segment with Cardiology, Diabetology, Neuro-Psychiatry, and Pain Management in the emerging markets. It has a market share of 7.4% in Sri Lanka with 30 brands ranked first in their respective molecule categories. It is also the 2nd largest company in South Africa and the 9th largest in the Phillippines in the participated market. The segment revenue grew by 34% between FY22 and FY24, driven by strong demand across all key geographies.)
