/E (Cross-Border Commerce Landscape: Cross-border transactions vary by region: China \(13.5% of e-commerce\), USA \(7%\), India \(25%\), and Finland \(36%\). China is the top shopping destination for most emerging markets \(Indonesia, Mexico, Australia\), while USA dominates for Canada \(51%\) and Mexico \(51%\). Import tax regimes are tightening \(India raised duties on gifts from 0% to 41.2%; Indonesia cut de minimis from USD 75 to USD 3\) to protect domestic merchants.)
